  "details": "Most of the time when I try to change worlds the world will load as in the data, but.  When it says loading the world loads and I am outside the world looking in and I hear a deep tone noise then I get  the text.  Internal error and then it precedes to try to reload the world again and I can be in this loop for about 20 restarts or until I get fed up with VRChat and just close it down.  I have reinstalled VRChat, I have deleted cache folder and temporary folders, I have disabled IPV6 in my ethernet settings and nothing works.  Eventually the world will load but not after at least 10 restarts. Also verifying the integrity of files within Steam does nothing.",
